  <steps>
    <step order="1" name="Context check">Check context usage; handoff + stop if &gt; 70%.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Load knowledge">Read spec FR-25, ADR-028/024/015/021, and the W1 engine suggestion contract (tasks 011–012). Confirm task 072 NAA path is available.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Locate suggestion surface">Identify the BFF endpoint/contract that returns engine suggestions for a communication (from W1). Confirm the response carries target(s) + confidence + provenance.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Fetch in save pane">On save, call the suggestion surface via `authenticatedFetch` (NAA). Handle empty/pending states.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Render suggestions">Render suggestions (Fluent v9): top target + confidence + provenance rationale; controls to accept (1-click) or override (pick another target). Surface any AI-flagged privilege as a flag.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Apply on accept">On accept/override, apply the chosen association to the `sprk_communication` via `PolymorphicResolverService.applyResolverFields` (reuse; no new regarding mechanism).</step>
    <step order="7" name="Auth scoping">Ensure only auth-scoped suggestions are shown (NFR-07); the pane never decides privilege.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Build + deploy + smoke">Build + deploy via `office-addins-deploy`; smoke-test in dev: save an email, see suggestions, accept + override, verify the association is written.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="FULL quality gates">Invoke `code-review`; invoke `adr-check` against spec.md (ADR-028/024/015; NFR-07). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Update tracking">Mark task 074 ✅ in `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Reset state">Update `current-task.md`: status → completed; advance; record decisions.</step>
  </steps>

